# Backend (`apps/backend`)

- Modular NestJS; follow existing module/port/adapter layout.
- Authz and writes are backend-owned. Prefer existing identity and capability patterns.
- DB changes go through `infrastructure/postgres` migrations — do not invent ad-hoc schema in app code.
- Check `docs/04-api/` and `docs/05-security/` before changing auth or public routes.
